   294	      "workflow run listings, the queue's own closed work items, and its git history.",
   295	      '',
   296	      'Hour rows cover the last three days; day rows are recomputed from scratch every',
   297	      'run from the sources still readable; week rows are appended once, past the',
   298	      '`foldedThrough` watermark. The run and queue rows are appended once past their',
   299	      'own watermarks — both are rate-limited REST reads, not a local branch.',
   300	      'A recompute that differs only in its `generated` stamp opens no PR at all.',
   301	      'Machine-written — never hand-edit it.',
   302	    ].join('\n'),
   303	  });
