101	// git, so it is free and recomputed every run — a counting fix heals the whole window
102	// the way the capture-derived rows do.
103	//
104	// A SHALLOW CHECKOUT IS THE NORMAL CASE in Actions, and it is why this returns a
105	// covered-from date rather than a map with zeroes in it: the history simply stops
